es never guess answers and every catalogue-state transition is reproducible.\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0003.md b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0003.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..e314c22d0280e6dc09d928910c896c9fb9d26123\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0003.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@\n+---\n+task_id: G0003\n+sequence: 3\n+dependencies: GB0002,G0002\n+title: Define tutorial and standard-round bible\n+browser_impact: not_applicable\n+playwright_spec:\n+design_authoring_batch: GB0002\n+---\n+\n+## Objective\n+\n+Write accepted evidence for GAME-005\u2013006/GPI-008\u2013009: TUT-01\u201305, mixed 10-card round selection, optional timer, offline lifecycle, interruption and shortage behaviour.\n+\n+## Acceptance criteria\n+\n+- Every named tutorial card and round transition has a deterministic fixture.\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0004.md b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0004.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..e2a970ef72fb8eddda694aeffd094a6e6662cfee\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0004.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@\n+---\n+task_id: G0004\n+sequence: 3\n+dependencies: G0003\n+title: Define scoring and results bible\n+browser_impact: not_applicable\n+playwright_spec:\n+design_authoring_batch: GB0002\n+---\n+\n+## Objective\n+\n+Write accepted evidence for GAME-007\u2013008/GPI-010\u2013011: 100-point capped-streak table, feedback equivalents, result states, milestone idempotence, and 18 edge/lifecycle fixtures.\n+\n+## Acceptance criteria\n+\n+- Wrong, blank, timeout, and abandon remain recoverable and do not create duplicate completion.\ndiff --git a/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0005.md b/projects/football-trivia-e2e/game-design-runbooks/G0005.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 000000000000000